<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 94 0 R
/E ( This image shows the entire Netherlands. It shows how many kilos of household waste are thrown away per person per year. You can see that a lot of waste is thrown away in the north, while in the center of the Netherlands, it's less and average. The average is 450 kilos of household waste. This is a huge amount. Some of this waste also consists of food that was actually still good to eat. This means that we are all wasting a huge amount of food, even though it's completely unnecessary.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
