<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Many different measures are already being taken to combat food waste in Alphen aan den Rijn. For example, there's the food bank, where all expired food is sent so it can be used in another way. Supermarkets also discount products that are about to expire so they can still be sold. Supermarkets also buy limited stock to avoid overstocking and having to throw away half of it because it hasn't been sold. There's also Eetbaar Alphen.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
